{"turn_id": "d04-t2", "session_id": "d04", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "abstract_outperforms_baselines", "text": "摘要指出，实证评估表明该方法的性能显著优于基线（significantly outperforms baselines）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}]}, {"key": "conclusions_consistently_outperforms", "text": "结论部分称整体实验结果表明，该方法在标准评测数据集上始终优于现有基线方法。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}, {"key": "competitive_without_ctakes", "text": "论文称其研究证明，在不借助cTAKES这类领域专用特征抽取工具的情况下也能获得有竞争力的结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}, {"key": "only_basic_nlp_modules", "text": "结论指出该系统只使用分词和词性标注等基础自然语言处理模块。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}, {"key": "no_numeric_margin_in_supplied_evidence", "text": "在所提供证据中，论文仅以“显著优于基线”和“始终优于现有基线方法”进行定性描述，未给出具体的性能提升数值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d04-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
